# IOMMU residual parity mapping for QEMU migration tracking.
# Format: original_case|required_smoke_case|status|notes
# - Empty lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# - `original_case` must exist in kernel/src/io/iommu/tests.rs.
# - `required_smoke_case` must exist in kernel/src/io/iommu/qemu_tests.rs and be wired to suite_kernel.

